  "concerns": [
    "BILLING UNIT MISMATCH (pre-existing app defect): POST /api/events/:eventId/line-items/generate-from-beo (apps/oto-app/server/beo-routes.ts:2167 and :2193) copies the package snapshot unit_price and the entertainment selection price (satang) unconverted into event_line_items.unit_price_inc_vat, which the billing module formats as THB (shared/vat-utils.ts formatThb). Once staff apply one of these real packages to a party and press Generate from BEO, a 5,000 THB add-on would bill as 500,000 THB. Needs a fix ticket before anyone bills a party from these templates.",
